# A repository-level `dist/` rule, left unanchored, also matches inside the
# bundled MCP servers and drops the very files the registry points at — a fresh clone then fails `resolve_registry` and every
# sync script exits non-zero. Re-include the directory first: git cannot
# re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded.
!.agents/mcp-servers/*/dist/
